					{"key": "ribbon", "at": Vector2(0.7, 20.4), "name": "a blue ribbon", "text": "A blue ribbon on a nail: for the ones who went up singing. Tied by Tam Cooper's mother, who has not stopped. Beside it, a red one, much newer, tied by someone who only wanted to be like her."},
