		"alt": {"pin": {4: "Tell Bet the letter is pinned to the post"}, "burn": {4: "Tell Bet you burned it at the fire"}, "keep": {4: "Tell Bet you brought it back"}},
		"reward": {"ash": 20, "items": {"relic_fragment": 1}},
		"choose": [{"set": "kindler", "slot": "focus", "rarity": 2}, {"set": "tally", "slot": "girdle", "rarity": 2}],
		"leaves": {"pin": {"at": Vector2(-2.0, 18.5), "prop": "page"}, "burn": {"at": Vector2(-2.0, 18.5), "prop": "lantern_lit"}, "keep": {"at": Vector2(-2.0, 18.5), "prop": "mark"}},
		"outcome": {"pin": "Bet took it in with her hands in her apron. 'With the others,' she said. 'In company. He never liked to be the only one.' She smiled, with great care, and went in, and shut the door, and you heard her begin, very softly, to write a new one.",
			"burn": "'Smoke,' said Bet. 'He liked a good fire.' She went out onto the step and watched the green's fire for a long time, and Col, across the way, who had been going to say something about boots, thought better of it and lifted a hand.",
